{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And if he strikes</b> — these two verses begin with vav and end with vav: וכי יכה תחת עינו / ואם שן עבדו תחת שנו. Behold, 24 corresponding to 24 limbs through which he goes free. And there are in them 26 words; when you add with them שן and עין, they become 26 limbs. And likewise in ויאמר ארור כנען / ויאמר ברוך ה' אלהי שם — 26 words, and they begin with vav and end with vav."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:55.150798967Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}